 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-2-1\">2.1 Leitura do arquivo</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> carrega o arquivo em um DataFrame e guarda uma cópia dos dados brutos.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> é sempre o primeiro passo. Mantenha <code>df_original</code> intocado para poder comparar ou recomeçar sem precisar reler o arquivo.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> USAR_DADOS_EXEMPLO:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    df = <span class=\"tk-fn\">gerar_dados_exemplo</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    tabela_categorias, eventos = <span class=\"tk-fn\">gerar_tabelas_auxiliares</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_csv</span>(CAMINHO_DADOS)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    tabela_categorias = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_csv</span>(CAMINHO_TABELA_CATEGORIAS)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">    eventos = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_csv</span>(CAMINHO_EVENTOS, parse_dates=[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_data_evento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">df_original = df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">copy</span>()   <span class=\"tk-com\"># cópia de segurança dos dados brutos</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">head</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_id</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_ordinal</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_binaria</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_valor_texto</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data_fim</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_multivalor</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6.10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">73.07</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.995,77</td>\n<td>06/10/2024</td>\n<td>20/10/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2;item_3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td class=\"num\">2</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">12.90</td>\n<td class=\"num\">95.14</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.236,47</td>\n<td>02/09/2024</td>\n<td>12/09/2024</td>\n<td>item_2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td class=\"num\">3</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>alto</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">12.40</td>\n<td class=\"num\">111.55</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.994,47</td>\n<td>03/12/2024</td>\n<td>10/12/2024</td>\n<td>item_1;item_4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">3</th>\n<td class=\"num\">4</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">8.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">78.46</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.155,97</td>\n<td>01/10/2024</td>\n<td>03/10/2024</td>\n<td>item_3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td class=\"num\">5</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6.90</td>\n<td class=\"num\">438.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.154,87</td>\n<td>24/06/2024</td>\n<td>29/06/2024</td>\n<td>item_2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"parametros-de-leitura-mais-uteis\">Parâmetros de leitura mais úteis</h3>\n<div aria-label=\"Parâmetros de leitura mais úteis\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Situação</th>\n<th>Parâmetro</th>\n<th>Exemplo</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Arquivo separado por <code>;</code> (comum em dados brasileiros)</td>\n<td><code>sep</code></td>\n<td><code>sep=';'</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Acentos aparecendo como <code>Ã§</code>, ou <code>UnicodeDecodeError</code></td>\n<td><code>encoding</code></td>\n<td><code>encoding='latin-1'</code> ou <code>'cp1252'</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decimal com vírgula e milhar com ponto (<code>1.234,56</code>)</td>\n<td><code>decimal</code>, <code>thousands</code></td>\n<td><code>decimal=',', thousands='.'</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Usar uma coluna como índice (ex.: ID)</td>\n<td><code>index_col</code></td>\n<td><code>index_col='coluna_id'</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ler só algumas colunas (arquivos grandes)</td>\n<td><code>usecols</code></td>\n<td><code>usecols=['coluna_1', 'coluna_2']</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Converter datas já na leitura</td>\n<td><code>parse_dates</code>, <code>dayfirst</code></td>\n<td><code>parse_dates=['coluna_data'], dayfirst=True</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Valores que significam \"vazio\"</td>\n<td><code>na_values</code></td>\n<td><code>na_values=['-', 'NA', 'Não informado']</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># CSV no padrão brasileiro</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_csv</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_do_arquivo.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, sep=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">;</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, encoding=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">cp1252</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, decimal=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">,</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, thousands=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Excel (requer openpyxl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_excel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_do_arquivo.xlsx</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, sheet_name=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_da_aba</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Vários arquivos com a mesma estrutura (ex.: um por mês/ano)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">arquivos = <span class=\"tk-bi\">sorted</span>(<span class=\"tk-fn\">Path</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">dados</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">glob</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">*_nome_do_arquivo.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">df = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">concat</span>([pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_csv</span>(a, sep=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">;</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> a <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> arquivos], ignore_index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Datasets de prática embutidos no seaborn (lista: sns.get_dataset_names())</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">df_pratica = sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">load_dataset</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_do_dataset</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div><aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Se <code>df.info()</code> mostrar números como texto, quase sempre o problema está em <code>sep</code>, <code>decimal</code> ou <code>thousands</code>. Corrigir na leitura é mais limpo do que converter depois (Seção <a href=\"/preparar/limpeza-e-tratamento/#secao-4-2\">4.2</a>).</li>\n<li>Arquivos relacionados (por exemplo, uma tabela principal e tabelas de detalhe) podem ser combinados por uma chave em comum com <code>pd.merge</code> (Seção <a href=\"/preparar/limpeza-e-tratamento/#secao-4-10\">4.10</a>) ou diretamente em SQL (Seção <a href=\"/preparar/consultas-sql/#secao-2-3\">2.3</a>).</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-2-2\">2.2 Dicionário de dados</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> associa cada coluna ao seu significado.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> quando o dataset vem com um arquivo de descrição (schema). Ler esse arquivo antes de analisar evita interpretações erradas.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">dicionario = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">read_csv</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_do_dicionario.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Se as descrições vierem com tags HTML, remova-as com regex</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">dicionario[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">descricao</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = (dicionario[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">descricao</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">                           .str.<span class=\"tk-fn\">replace</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">r</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">&lt;.*?&gt;</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, regex=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">                           .str.<span class=\"tk-fn\">strip</span>())</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> nome, desc <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">zip</span>(dicionario[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nome_coluna</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], dicionario[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">descricao</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    <span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>nome<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> -&gt; </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>desc<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div><aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p>Sem dicionário, documente você mesmo o significado de cada coluna, a unidade de medida (R$, dias, %, ...) e a origem dos dados.</p></div></aside>\n",
